{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこんばんは！\n新内眞衣です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遂に！\n「乃木坂46カフェ 2015 〜命は美しい〜｣\nがOpenしました〜*\\(^o^)/*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はビルの\nオープニングセレモニーにも\n参加させて頂いたり"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/03/28/5431734/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(テープカット！(◎_◎;))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カフェの取材やら"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/03/28/5431734/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(運営ブログより)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めての経験に\nてんやわんやしてました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1月くらいから打ち合わせを重ねていたものが\nこうして形になるのは凄く嬉しいですし、\n頑張って良かったなと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん頑張ったのは私だけじゃなく、\nメンバーもたくさん協力してくれたし、\nスタッフさんなんて私の何百倍も大変だった\nと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれた人が少しでも\nまた乃木坂46を好きになってくれたら\nいいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/03/28/5431734/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qプラザ原宿で待ってます！\n〜5/10まで！お見逃しなく！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！メンバーもいつでも来てね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/03/28/5431734/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カフェのど真ん中にある柱を\nメンバーのサインで埋めたいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/03/28/5431734/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/03/28/5431734/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木のの公開収録in富士Qハイランド"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日は乃木ののの公開収録を\nしてきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/03/28/5431734/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お天気が凄く良くて\n富士山が綺麗に見えるステージで\nライブが出来て楽しかったな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はポカポカ陽気だったから\n久しぶりに汗をかきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/03/28/5431734/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"順調に春ですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"余談ですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/03/28/5431734/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/03/28/5431734/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/03/28/5431734/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽屋では20overのこの子たちと\n荒ぶる遊びをしてました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ若いんだぞ★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/03/28/5431734/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラジオ『まいちゅんカフェ』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだ\n初回の収録をしてきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/03/28/5431734/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"OL兼任についてなどを話してきたよ！\n放送日の4月1日はOLを始めてから\n丁度1年なんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"節目だし、思いの丈を話すには\nいい機会でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに若様がゲストで来てくれて\nいくらか気持ちが落ち着きました！\nありがとうございますm(_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと！お便りの数が凄くたくさん\nあったみたいで！\n始まってもないのに\nbayfmの中でも上位のメール数\nらしいです（ ;  ; ）"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/03/28/5431734/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん、お便りたくさんありがとう\nございますm(_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"散々言ってますが、\n初回放送日は4/1です！\nお楽しみに*\\(^o^)/*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/03/28/5431734/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからbay fmさんでお世話になります。\n末長くよろしくお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/03/28/5431734/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2期生2周年"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2年前の今日は2期生の\n最終オーディションでした〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりんも言ってたけど、\n2期生はお披露目日も昇格日も違うので\n唯一同じ記念日が合格日なんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2年前と変わったこと\n変わらないこと\nたくさんありますが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"辞めてしまった仲間も含めて\n私は2期生が大好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/03/28/5431734/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだの年に1度の2期生会。\n全員は叶わなかったけど、\n楽しかった。\nりさことれなはまた今度〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/03/28/5431734/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2周年ありがとうございます。\nこれからもよろしく。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってな感じで、\n今日はこの辺でおしまいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また書きます！"}],"source":"archive"}